  (text "JDBG_P4 and JDBG_C6 are no-parts Tag-Connect footprints (DNL). Pin-1 VREF is sense/reference only, never a board power input." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 120 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "0d000067-d000-4d00-8d00-000000000068"))
  (text "P4 UART conditioning is already in sheet 04; C6 UART conditioning is already in sheet 05. Do not duplicate those series resistors here." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 125 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "0d000068-d000-4d00-8d00-000000000069"))
  (text "P4 USB Serial/JTAG uses GPIO24/25 through 22R/22R. DNP shunt capacitors are symmetrical tuning-only footprints." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "0d000069-d000-4d00-8d00-00000000006a"))
  (text "Factory recovery is independent of display/Wi-Fi/application firmware: P4 UART0, P4 USB Serial/JTAG and C6 UART/boot all remain accessible." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 135 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "0d00006a-d000-4d00-8d00-00000000006b"))
